???: Hey, I'm sorry now i really can't I've a lot of stuf...
Oh, you must be Jey's kid right? You got here just in time,

-> Can I see my father?
    ???: Wait, you didn't get the message? your father didn't make it. he's passed last, I'm sorry for your loss kiddo.
-> Where's his room? 
    ???: Wait, you didn't get the message? your father didn't make it. he's passed last, I'm sorry for your loss kiddo.
-> *let the woman finish what she's saying"
    ???: I'm sorry for your loss kiddo. your dad passed last week.
-> I have been hearing voices, do you know why? 
    Dad: Why would you tell her that idiot?
    -> Shut up!
        Kass: Excuse me? can you shut up?
        ->Sorry I wasn't talking to you
            Kass: you just got of the ship? it might be cryosickness.
        ->I was talking to my dad if you don't mind
            Kass: you just got of the ship? it might be cryosickness.
    -> ...
      Kass: you just got of the ship? it might be cryosickness.

But we do need you for something, your dad's eagle flight is gonna be tonight, and we need your signature on some documents.

-> Wait, what?!
    I just find out my father's dead and you start with that?!
    ???: Listen kid, I know it's hard but it's been two weeks since his passing. 
-> I'm sorry who are you?
    ???: Oh, I'm Kassandra you can call me Kass. 
    Kass: I'm a nurse here I helped your father in the last months. 

Kass: we really need your signature Kid.

-> what if I don't sign? 
    Kass: uff, then you would have until 19 today to find another solution, because then the SDA will be enacted. 
-> ok let's get this over with...

